                "description": "The Newport Lever with Carre Plate shows what amazing design can do for a room by adding stately ambiance and glamour. The classic blending of the Newport Rope Lever with the Steeped Carre Tall Plate come together to form something as beautiful as it is functional. The Carre Tall Plate with Newport Leverset is available in dummy, passage or privacy functions and will fit 1-3/8 inch to 2 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from a wide array of traditional finish colors. ",
